[node name="PawnRemote" type="Node3D"]

; The same placeholder body the local pawn wears. **The same script, not a
; copy**: a remote pawn that looked different from a local one would be a
; discriminator, and this game is built on players being indistinguishable.
; It has no CollisionShape3D to measure, so it falls back to the shipped
; capsule — which is the same number, from the same document.
